    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STORY</h2>One day, the unlucky girl &quot;Runa Ichiya&quot; wakes up in a haunted house.<br>Inside this house,there are a strange girl and different monsters.<br>While escaping from monsters, Runa has to solve the mystery of the &quot;Nightmare House&quot;,<br>find out why she is here and why the monsters are attacking her.<br>What will be her fate?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ABOUT</h2>&quot;RUNA IN NIGHTMARE HOUSE&quot; is a side-scrolling gothic-style horror game.<br>Your mission is to guide Runa Ichiya to the exit of this house.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SYSTEM</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Using items, solving puzzles, and playing minigames to open up your future<br></li><li>Some items are dangerous. They can bring you instant death.<br></li><li>Some monsters will chase Runa. Hide and don't let them find you.<br></li><li>There are multiple bad endings, normal endings, and one true ending.</li></ul>",
